WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.090
Let's wrap it up for today.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.170
We're out of target bottles.

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:26.670
Yeah.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:28.630
I'll go and get the horses.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:29.670
Okay!

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.270
Hey, Oscar!
Want to snack on an apple?

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:38.560
I'll take one!

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:40.390
Catch!

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:48.070
Wh-Who's there?!

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:52.550
Sorry about your apple!

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:55.380
I couldn't resist showing off my
sharpshooting skills to you two.

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:57.530
Anything changed, Oscar François?

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:00.490
Looking well as always, André!

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:06.780
Hans Axel von Fersen has just returned
from the American continent!

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:08.960
Fersen...!

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:11.300
<i>Fersen!</i>

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:15.340
<i>Fersen...!</i>

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:27.940
